games.ALE/Alien-v5:
Watch the video, guess the rule and play another round.
Attention 1: Getting caught by an enemy (alien) leads to failure and ends the game;
Attention 2: "Aliens' eggs" that fill the left half screen also exist in the right screen, but are transparent;
Attention 3: When you approach the shining star (the power-up pulsar), you will become transparent until you leave its neighborhood or collect it;
Attention 4: By collecting the shining star (the power-up pulsar), you can become invincible shortly.

games.ALE/RoadRunner-v5:
Watch the video, guess the rule and play another round.
Attention 1: Getting caught by the character which is running after you or hit by a truck leads to a failure and ends the game;
Attention 2: Collecting the first pile of bird seed gives 100 points. Successive collectings without a miss gives more points with the stride of 100, while a miss will reset this mechanism.

